    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="29">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIIIAtr">VIII Atr</ref> 29</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And gif he his lif misfadige, wanige his weorðscipe be þam þe seo dæd sy.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if he misdirects his life, his privileges shall be reduced, according to the nature of the offence.</ab>
